# Build context is the repo root (see apps/server/Dockerfile). Keep it small
# and keep local secrets and data out of any image.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.claude
.env
.env.*
**/*.tgz
docs
apps/cli/src
apps/cli/bin
apps/cli/test
apps/cli/scripts
apps/server/test
# The mini-program only contributes its manifest (npm ci needs every workspace).
apps/miniprogram/*
!apps/miniprogram/package.json
packages/*/test
*.md
